    "name": "Bee-z Factory",
    "steam_appid": 3374790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bee-z Factory is a farm based colony-sim, where your goal is to provide guidance to a species of highly temperamental space colonizers called sproutlings, that find themselves stranded on a isolated solar system. Help them to survive, and uncover mysteries of this planet that looks strangely familiar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/69c8893291158be014bab192c6a37758.avif?t=1745669396\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starting with only your bare hands, harvest the local flora, learn new technologies and build highly advanced machinery that will help you build your way out of this planet.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/f1ac6e6542d85f28dd43e55b68b2261a.poster.avif?t=1745669396\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/f1ac6e6542d85f28dd43e55b68b2261a.webm?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/f1ac6e6542d85f28dd43e55b68b2261a.mp4?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take advantage of whateaver resource you can find, create complex machinery and build your own self-sufficient colony.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Produce!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/7704a7ec8ee9388d6a8916bf5e22c60d.poster.avif?t=1745669396\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/7704a7ec8ee9388d6a8916bf5e22c60d.webm?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/7704a7ec8ee9388d6a8916bf5e22c60d.mp4?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources are presented in nature as finite, it is up to you to find a way of automating their production in a self-sustained colony.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/b17f6118e344aa2e35453b923288b88d.poster.avif?t=1745669396\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/b17f6118e344aa2e35453b923288b88d.webm?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/b17f6118e344aa2e35453b923288b88d.mp4?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature is hostile, so seek shelter and protect yourself! Build anything you desire, from simple villages o highly advanced cities, all while providing comfort to your sproutlings.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/b347a627f2fa413ac352d8c175b3eac2.poster.avif?t=1745669396\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/b347a627f2fa413ac352d8c175b3eac2.webm?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/b347a627f2fa413ac352d8c175b3eac2.mp4?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature is in contant change, all seasons come packed with their own set of challenges, adapt and survive them all!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/afe8838ecbdf1280085937a6a0126a28.poster.avif?t=1745669396\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/afe8838ecbdf1280085937a6a0126a28.webm?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/afe8838ecbdf1280085937a6a0126a28.mp4?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do no settle! Exploration is highly rewarded. While you study ways of getting out of this isolated system, explore neighboring planets in search for resources and answers.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/b9f5d61ab1c6c2cc490f745b618c8d0d.avif?t=1745669396\" width=600 height=72 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/70b67962b2a641d9f42dda31f207f5e4.poster.avif?t=1745669396\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/70b67962b2a641d9f42dda31f207f5e4.webm?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/70b67962b2a641d9f42dda31f207f5e4.mp4?t=1745669396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
